{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202480","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202480","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1220248001:0":{"text":"是……水？好干净……我从没见过这么干净的水！","source_cn":"是……水？好干净……我从没见过这么干净的水！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54B9B2A6153BD011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220248002:0":{"text":"让、让开！让我先喝一口！","source_cn":"让、让开！让我先喝一口！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F32536804E32D65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220248003:0":{"text":"不、不行——我还没喝够！","source_cn":"不、不行——我还没喝够！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD4D0C2788C1B2DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220248004:0":{"text":"竟然是真的，干净的，还带点甜味的水！我真的不是在做梦！","source_cn":"竟然是真的，干净的，还带点甜味的水！我真的不是在做梦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E3DB30E75BCE8B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220248005:0":{"text":"兄弟，你——","source_cn":"兄弟，你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC981309829E32414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220248006:0":{"text":"咦？你是百炼工坊的呼金？！我远远望见过你的脸